            "review_title": "Review at NYDC - Parkson Cantavil|",
            "review_text": "Ablingdon\nJakarta, Indonesia157 contributions\n0\nOdd service\nMar 2015 • Family\nI have eaten here twice. The first time I ordered a burger and fries. The cafe was not busy and there were four members of staff yet my order took ages. 2 chatting,mine on phone. I didn't get the burger but ate my fries. After waiting for over half an hour I asked where my burger was. The waiter hadn't ordered it. He said I would have it in 5 minutes. After 20 I gave up and insisted on paying for what I'd had. Big argument with the waiter who still expected me to wait. Next time I ask to sit in a booth. I get told that is the manager's table. I asked if it was reserved. No.They refuse to let me sit there, saying I have to pay 3000000dong service charge. No one came to sit there when I was there. Don't see much point in having nice booths if you won't let people sit in them. But, food arrived quickly. Taste is quite good, although too much sugary BBQ sauce on Piggly wiggly burger.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 8, 2015",
